{
  "cmyk_method": "Separated from sRGB with LittleCMS (Pillow ImageCms) using the Ghostscript sRGB profile and the Artifex CMYK SWOP profile (default_cmyk.icc), Relative Colorimetric intent. Values rounded to whole percentages. This is a US SWOP-like coated separation, not FOGRA39 / ISO Coated v2 and not GRACoL 2013. European printers should re-separate to FOGRA39 (ISO Coated v2 300%) in prepress; North American printers should re-separate to GRACoL 2013 (CRPC6) if that is the house profile. Treat these CMYK builds as starting points.",
  "pantone_method": "Nearest coated matches ranked by CIEDE2000 (D65/2\u00b0, sRGB-encoded Lab) against a compiled table of commonly circulated Pantone Color Bridge / converter *screen* hex approximations. These are not official Pantone-published measurements. Uncoated recommendations are the same PMS number in the Uncoated library (conventional C/U pairing), not a separately computed nearest-U. Every match is a nearest match and must be verified against a physical Pantone Coated or Uncoated guide before printing.",
